cell>Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1</cell><cell>46.7B</cell><cell>0.22</cell><cell>0.07</cell><cell>0.05</cell><cell>0.00</cell><cell>0.01</cell><cell>0.32</cell><cell>0.13</cell><cell>0.14</cell><cell>0.09</cell><cell>0.09</cell></row><row><cell>xLAM-8x7b-fc-r</cell><cell>46.7B</cell><cell>0.40</cell><cell>0.15</cell><cell>0.16</cell><cell>0.01</cell><cell>0.01</cell><cell>0.43</cell><cell>0.16</cell><cell>0.17</cell><cell>0.02</cell><cell>0.03</cell></row><row><cell>Llama-3-1-70B-Instruct</cell><cell>70B</cell><cell>0.41</cell><cell>0.19</cell><cell>0.15</cell><cell>0.04</cell><cell>0.09</cell><cell>0.33</cell><cell>0.17</cell><cell>0.15</cell><cell>0.07</cell><cell>0.11</cell></row><row><cell>Mixtral-8x22B-Instruct-v0.1</cell><cell>141B</cell><cell>0.49</cell><cell>0.21</cell><cell>0.17</cell><cell>0.06</cell><cell>0.07</cell><cell>0.65</cell><cell>0.29</cell><cell>0.28</cell><cell>0.21</cell><cell>0.23</cell></row><row><cell>xLAM-8x22b-fc-r</cell><cell>141B</cell><cell>0.53</cell><cell>0.21</cell><cell>0.22</cell><cell>0.12</cell><cell>0.03</cell><cell>0.50</cell><cell>0.23</cell><cell>0.25</cell><cell>0.17</cell><cell>0.06</cell></row><row><cell>Llama-3-1-405B-Instruct-fp8</cell><cell>405B</cell><cell>0.41</cell><cell>0.14</cell><cell>0.08</cell><cell>0.03</cell><cell>0.10</cell><cell>0.41</cell><cell>0.18</cell><cell>0.13</cell><cell>0.07</cell><cell>0.14</cell></row><row><cell>DeepSeek-V3</cell><cell>685B</cell><cell>0.69</cell><cell>0.36</cell><cell>0.27</cell><cell>0.09</cell><cell>0.43</cell><cell>0.69</cell><cell>0.42</cell><cell>0.37</cell><cell>0.29</cell><cell>0.60</cell></row><row><cell>GPT-4o (2024-08-06)</cell><cell>UNK</cell><cell>0.73</cell><cell>0.41</cell><cell>0.38</cell><cell>0.28</cell><cell>0.59</cell><cell>0.74</cell><cell>0.41</cell><cell>0.38</cell><cell>0.28</cell><cell>0.60</cell></row></table><note><p>learning (ICL) examples, and some random APIs, keeping the total prompt length under 4K tokens.</p></note></figure>\n\t\t\t<note xmlns=\"htt